    "questionText": "When a statutory auditor of a company is threatened by the Board of Directors with replacement in the upcoming AGM unless he issues an unqualified audit report overlooking an irregular inter-corporate loan under Section 186, which specific ethical threat under the ICAI Code of Ethics is triggered?",
